      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹3.21 (vs ₹1.63 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.21 (up from ₹1.63 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.09b (up 24% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹30.4m (up 125% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.8% (up from 1.5% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 4% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 34% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
